1,Ta-Arawakan languages - Wikipedia,https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ta-Arawakan_languages,"The Ta-Arawakan languages, also known as Ta-Maipurean and Caribbean, are the Indigenous Arawakan languages of the Caribbean islands and mostly coastal South America. They are distinguished by the first person pronominal prefix ta-, as opposed to common Arawakan na-.",Guarequena,Maipurean
